post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Omdrop is installed. Each user who wants it runs, once:

  /usr/bin/omdrop setup

That adds Omdrop to the bar and installs the receiver service. The full
path matters if you installed Omdrop with `omarchy plugin add` before: a
plain `omdrop` may still run that copy. setup asks before replacing it.
The radio comes from a separate package: brcmfmac-awdl-dkms on an Apple
Silicon Mac, omdrop-owl on other Wi-Fi cards. `omdrop doctor` says what
is missing.
MSG
}
